# A folder downloaded as a zip (DriveScreen.kt saveZip): held, ⋯ → 下载为 zip: the station zips it (drive.zip), the zip
# is read through the core and kept with the downloads.
#env MBUI_OPEN_PAGE=files
timeout 90000
until =e2e-{T}
tap =e2e-{T}
until 子文件夹
wait 500
hold 900 子文件夹
until 已选 1 项
tap icon:more
until 下载为 zip
shot 1-sheet
tap 下载为 zip
until 正在下载「子文件夹.zip」
timeout 120000
until 已保存到「下载」
shot 2-saved
